  "description": "Brighten your creative projects with this collection of 15 pink and yellow diagonal stripe seamless patterns. Featuring a cheerful color palette and clean repeating striped designs, this versatile pattern bundle is ideal for creating eye-catching backgrounds, digital papers, stationery, fabric prints, invitations, scrapbooking projects, packaging, and more. The seamless repeat format makes it easy to create continuous designs for both digital and print applications.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Scrapbooking and digital paper projects\n•Invitations and greeting cards\n•Planners, journals, and stationery\n•Fabric and textile designs\n•Wrapping paper and packaging\n•Wallpapers and decorative backgrounds\n•Nursery and kids’ projects\n•Printable and DIY projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Brighten your creative projects with this collection of 15 pink and yellow diagonal stripe seamless patterns. Featuring a cheerful color palette and clean repeating striped designs, this versatile pattern bundle is ideal for creating eye-catching backgrounds, digital papers, stationery, fabric prints, invitations, scrapbooking projects, packaging, and more. The seamless repeat format makes it easy to create continuous designs for both digital and print applications.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n•15 seamless patterns<br>\n•Format: JPEG<br>\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n•High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n•Scrapbooking and digital paper projects<br>\n•Invitations and greeting cards<br>\n•Planners, journals, and stationery<br>\n•Fabric and textile designs<br>\n•Wrapping paper and packaging<br>\n•Wallpapers and decorative backgrounds<br>\n•Nursery and kids’ projects<br>\n•Printable and DIY projects</p>",
